   604	in time ~O(logd·n γ), and
   605	3. given an integeri, there exists a functionfthat returns the prime factors ofAi in time
   606	~O(nγ).
   607	Then there is a deterministic algorithm to compute the prime factorization ofNin time
   608	~O(Nγ/2 log(k(n))).
